        <obo:IAO_0000115>CRF sectors (IPCC 2006) is a version of the common reporting format that was used for national greenhouse gas inventories since the year 2015. It implements the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories (with some deviations).</obo:IAO_0000115>
