        <obo:IAO_0000115>CRF sectors (IPCC 1996) is a version of the common reporting format that was used for national greenhouse gas inventories until the year 2014. It implements the Revised 1996 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories (with some deviations).</obo:IAO_0000115>
