        <obo:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) &apos;transport&apos; is a transport sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
Emissions from the combustion and evaporation of fuel for all transport activity (excluding military transport), regardless of the sector, specified by sub-categories below. Emissions from fuel sold to any air or marine vessel engaged in international transport (1 A 3 a i and 1 A 3 d i) should as far as possible be excluded from the totals and subtotals in this category and should be reported separately.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories, Volume 2, Chapter 3.1, https://www.ipcc-nggip.iges.or.jp/public/2006gl/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">CRF sector (IPCC 2006): transport</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00010037>CRF 1.A.3</oeo:OEO_00010037>
