        <oeo:OEO_00000504 rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000242"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) &apos;fugitive emissions from fuels&apos; is a sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
Includes all intentional and unintentional emissions from the extraction, processing, storage and transport of solid fuel to the point of final use.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories, Volume 1, Chapter 8.5, https://www.ipcc-nggip.iges.or.jp/public/2006gl/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">CRF sector (IPCC 2006): fugitive emissions from fuels</rdfs:label>
        <oeo:OEO_00010037>CRF 1.B</oeo:OEO_00010037>
        <oeo:OEO_00020426>issue: https://github.com/OpenEnergyPlatform/ontology/issues/580
