        <obo:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) &apos;road transport&apos; is a transport sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
All combustion and evaporative emissions arising from fuel use in road vehicles, including the use of agricultural vehicles on paved roads.</obo:IAO_0000115>
