        <obo:IAO_0000115>The KSG sector energy industry is an energy transformation sector defined by the KSG sector division. It is an aggregate of the following three sectors:
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): energy industry (CRF 1.A.1.a)
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): other transportation (CRF 1.A.3.e)
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): fugitive emissions from fuels (CRF 1.B)</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000118 xml:lang="de">KSG-Sektor Energiewirtschaft</obo:IAO_0000118>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>Bundes-Klimaschutzgesetz (KSG), Anlage 1 (zu den §§ 4 und 5) https://www.gesetze-im-internet.de/ksg/anlage_1.html</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">KSG sector energy industry</rdfs:label>
