        <obo:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) &apos;public electricity and heat production&apos; is an energy transformation sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
Sum of emissions from main activity producers of electricity generation, combined heat and power generation, and heat plants.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories, Volume 2, Chapter 2.2, https://www.ipcc-nggip.iges.or.jp/public/2006gl/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">CRF sector (IPCC 2006): public electricity and heat production</rdfs:label>
