        <oeo:OEO_00000504 rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000242"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) &apos;settlements&apos; is an agriculture, forestry and land use sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
Emissions and removals from all developed land, including transportation infrastructure and human settlements of any size, unless they are already included under other categories.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories, Volume 1, Chapter 8.5, https://www.ipcc-nggip.iges.or.jp/public/2006gl/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">CRF sector (IPCC 2006): settlements</rdfs:label>
