        <obo:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) &apos;other land&apos; is an agriculture, forestry and land use sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories:
Emissions and removals from bare soil, rock, ice, and all unmanaged land areas that do not fall into any of the other five categories.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories, Volume 1, Chapter 8.5, https://www.ipcc-nggip.iges.or.jp/public/2006gl/</obo:IAO_0000119>
