        <obo:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006) &apos;international aviation&apos; is a transport sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories. It encompasses emissions from flights that depart in one country and arrive in a different country.</obo:IAO_0000115>
