        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">The MMR sector division is an EU emission sector division defined in Annex XII, Table 1 of Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 749/2014. It uses CRF sectors (IPCC 2006) and adds further sectors.</obo:IAO_0000115>
