        <oeo:OEO_00000504 rdf:resource="https://openenergyplatform.org/ontology/oeo/OEO_00000242"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The CRF sector (IPCC 2006): &apos;CO2 emissions from biomass&apos; is a sector defined by the 2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories: CO2 emissions from biomass combustion are not included in national totals, but are recorded as an information item for cross-checking purposes as well as avoiding double counting.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000119>2006 IPCC Guidelines for National Greenhouse Gas Inventories, Volume 2, Chapter 1, https://www.ipcc-nggip.iges.or.jp/public/2006gl/</obo:IAO_0000119>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">CRF sector (IPCC 2006): CO2 emissions from biomass</rdfs:label>
