        <obo:IAO_0000115>The NC/BR sector &quot;energy&quot; is a sector defined by an NC/BR sector division that includes all energy use that is not related to transport or industry. The sector includes:
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): energy industry
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): fuel combustion - other sectors
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): fuel combustion - other
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): fugitive emissions from fuels
- CRF sector (IPCC 2006): CO2 transport and storage</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">NC/BR sector: energy</rdfs:label>
